WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:08.200
Charge a late fee, and ask for approval to write off what will never be paid.

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.710
Everything about collecting one invoice is on the invoice itself.

3
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:22.810
Under Collections you can send a reminder, or charge the late fee set in the settings.

4
00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:28.890
If the money will never come, choose Write off.

5
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:33.300
Give the amount and the reason.

6
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.820
Write-offs always need a manager's approval, so choose Ask for approval.

7
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:46.960
The request goes to Approvals and tasks. Once approved, the debt is written off and the accounts are updated.

8
00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:52.080
Every write-off, and who approved it, is listed under Write-offs in Collections.
